# Business Partner rules

- Keep all Business Partner development within its own product permissions and data domain.
- Do not inherit offensive security tools, exploit primitives, or Hacker execution capabilities.
- Financial and operational calculations must be deterministic, reviewable, and auditable.
- Recommendations must distinguish verified facts, estimates, and assumptions.
- External actions must follow the approved approval policy and exact action scoping.
